    {
      "refKey": "Ps.18.6",
      "refDisplay": "Psal. XV II, 6",
      "refKeyPrinted": null,
      "corrected": true,
      "correctionNote": "A space split the Roman numeral: XV II for XVIII. The quoted words are Ps. 18:6-7 (Vulg.) — 'exsultavit ut gigas ad currendam viam; a summo caelo egressio eius' — so the reference is certain from the quotation itself, and no numeral is being reinterpreted, only rejoined. Printed form kept verbatim in the text and in refDisplay; the indexer could not parse the split numeral at all, so this is the difference between the citation reaching the scripture index and vanishing from it.",
